WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.040
The generated payment test starts with an
approved rule: reject a negative amount.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:08.960
The agent receives scoped
contract and repository context,

00:00:08.992 --> 00:00:14.320
then proposes a candidate. A gateway
authorizes only the permitted sandbox run.

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:18.000
The candidate must catch a selected
boundary fault, and the reviewer

00:00:18.044 --> 00:00:21.920
receives the assertions and execution
evidence before a merge decision.

00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:25.040
The generated test
cannot silently redefine

00:00:25.060 --> 00:00:28.400
the expected behavior to match
a defective implementation.
